{"seq":1,"slug":"per-market-aggregation","title":"分市场预测与层级汇总调和","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/demand-forecast-replenishment/multi-market-forecast/per-market-aggregation","wordCount":3028,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"分市场预测与层级汇总调和\">分市场预测与层级汇总调和</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-层级一致性与聚合矩阵\">核心概念：层级一致性与聚合矩阵</h2><p>把预测做对了一半，剩下的另一半可能就毁在汇总上。一个典型场景：三个区域仓各自预测下周共售 1000 件，把它们加起来是 1000；但总部对全国的单体预测给出 1150；而按品类汇总又是 980。三个数字在各自的报告里都合法，放在同一张会议桌上却无法解释。这不是模型问题，而是<strong>层级结构在处理过程中丢失了</strong>——每条序列被独立预测，约束（父子关系）从来没有被写进优化目标。本文讲的是如何把这个约束显式地纳入预测，也就是预测调和（forecast reconciliation）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"层级结构的定义与四个维度\">层级结构的定义与四个维度</h2><p>零售需求的层级通常在四个维度上同时存在，彼此正交：</p>\n<p><strong>地理维度</strong>：全球 → 区域（如 EMEA）→ 国家 → 履约节点（仓/门店）。这一维的约束最强，因为物理库存必须落在节点上，而报表要看国家与区域。</p>\n<p><strong>产品维度</strong>：全部商品 → 类目 → 子类目 → 品牌/系列 → SKU。促销与品类管理都在这一维上运作。</p>\n<p><strong>渠道维度</strong>：全渠道 → 线上/线下 → 平台/自营 → 店铺。</p>\n<p><strong>时间维度</strong>：年 → 季 → 月 → 周 → 日。这一维容易被忽略，但它是「月度计划与周度执行不一致」的根源。</p>\n<p>把这四个维度做笛卡尔积会得到一个极端稀疏的结构（大多数叶子组合为空），所以实践中不需要全交叉，而是定义一棵或几棵<strong>聚合树</strong>，每棵树覆盖业务实际关心的一组层级。调和在这棵树或树集合上进行。</p>\n<p>形式化地，设叶子层预测向量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{b}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">b</span></span></span></span></span>（长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span>，共 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 条最细序列），所有层级节点的预测向量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{y}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span>（长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n &gt; m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span>），则存在一个只含 0/1 的<strong>聚合矩阵</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">S</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{S} \\in \\{0,1\\}^{n \\times m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7252em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0213em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 使得层级一致性要求为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{y} = \\mathbf{S}\\mathbf{b}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Sb</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>调和的目标就是：给定一组独立的基预测 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde{\\mathbf{y}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8757em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6813em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.3634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（各层级各自预测的结果，通常不一致），找出一组满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">S</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\mathbf{y}} = \\mathbf{S}\\hat{\\mathbf{b}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9023em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7079em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">S</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">b</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的调和预测，且尽可能接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde{\\mathbf{y}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8757em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6813em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.3634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三种朴素策略及其失效场景\">三种朴素策略及其失效场景</h2><p>在通用调和框架出现之前，实践中有三种简单做法，它们分别在不同的数据条件下失效。</p>\n<p><strong>自下而上（bottom-up）</strong>：只预测叶子层，再直接相加得到所有上层。它保证一致性，且保留了叶子层的信息；失效场景是<strong>叶子层噪声大</strong>——长尾 SKU 的预测误差很大，逐层相加时这些误差会累积，导致上层预测被叶子的噪声污染。数据越稀疏，自下而上越差。</p>\n<p><strong>自上而下（top-down）</strong>：只预测顶层（如全国总销量），再按历史比例（或历史平均份额）向下分解。它在顶层预测较准、叶子很噪声时表现好；失效场景是<strong>份额不稳定</strong>——正在进行渠道迁移、新站开站、或某个 SKU 在生命周期不同阶段的商品，其历史份额无法代表未来份额。</p>\n<p><strong>中间层（middle-out）</strong>：预测某一中间层（如「国家 × 类目」），向上汇总、向下按比例分解。它是前两者的折中，也是很多企业实际上在用的方法；失效场景是它把「选哪一层」变成了一个额外的超参数，而这个选择往往靠经验而不是靠数据。</p>\n<p>三种策略的共同缺陷是：它们各自假设「某一层的预测比其它层可信」，但没有<strong>用误差本身来回答这个问题</strong>。而这个问题的正确答案显然与具体数据有关——哪些序列的预测误差小，就应该让它们的话语权更大。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[顶层: 全球总量] --&gt; B[区域: EMEA / APAC / AMER]&#10;  B --&gt; C[国家: DE / FR / JP / BR]&#10;  C --&gt; D[履约节点: 仓/门店]&#10;  A --&gt; E[产品树: 类目/子类/SKU]&#10;  D --&gt; F[叶子预测序列]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[自下而上: 直接求和&lt;br/&gt;叶子噪声累积]&#10;  A --&gt; H[自上而下: 按份额分解&lt;br/&gt;份额不稳定时失效]&#10;  B --&gt; I[中间层: 上汇下分&lt;br/&gt;层级选择靠经验]&#10;  G --&gt; J[调和: 用误差协方差定权重]&#10;  H --&gt; J&#10;  I --&gt; J&#10;  J --&gt; K[一致的预测: y = S b]\">graph TD\n  A[顶层: 全球总量] --&gt; B[区域: EMEA / APAC / AMER]\n  B --&gt; C[国家: DE / FR / JP / BR]\n  C --&gt; D[履约节点: 仓/门店]\n  A --&gt; E[产品树: 类目/子类/SKU]\n  D --&gt; F[叶子预测序列]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[自下而上: 直接求和&lt;br/&gt;叶子噪声累积]\n  A --&gt; H[自上而下: 按份额分解&lt;br/&gt;份额不稳定时失效]\n  B --&gt; I[中间层: 上汇下分&lt;br/&gt;层级选择靠经验]\n  G --&gt; J[调和: 用误差协方差定权重]\n  H --&gt; J\n  I --&gt; J\n  J --&gt; K[一致的预测: y = S b]</pre><h2 id=\"mint-用误差协方差统一三种策略\">MinT：用误差协方差统一三种策略</h2><p>Wickramasuriya、Athanasopoulos 与 Hyndman（<em>Journal of the American Statistical Association</em>，2019，114(526):804-819，<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1080/01621459.2018.1448825\">https://doi.org/10.1080/01621459.2018.1448825</a> ）提出的 MinT（Minimum Trace）把上面三种策略统一成一个带权最小二乘问题。它要找的是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">S</mi><mtext> </mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">arg min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi></munder><mtext>  </mtext><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi><msup><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mrow><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">W</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\mathbf{y}} = \\mathbf{S}\\,\\hat{\\mathbf{b}}, \\qquad\n\\hat{\\mathbf{b}} = \\operatorname*{arg\\,min}_{\\mathbf{b}} \\; \\bigl(\\tilde{\\mathbf{y}} - \\mathbf{S}\\mathbf{b}\\bigr)^{\\!\\top} \\mathbf{W}^{-1} \\bigl(\\tilde{\\mathbf{y}} - \\mathbf{S}\\mathbf{b}\\bigr)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9023em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7079em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1523em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">b</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">b</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.7965em;vertical-align:-0.9465em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1535em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathbf mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">arg</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9465em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6813em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.3634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.439em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Sb</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.089em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.3029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6813em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.3634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Sb</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>解的形式是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">S</mi><mrow><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">W</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">S</mi><msup><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">S</mi><mrow><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">W</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\mathbf{b}} = \\bigl(\\mathbf{S}^{\\!\\top}\\mathbf{W}^{-1}\\mathbf{S}\\bigr)^{-1}\\mathbf{S}^{\\!\\top}\\mathbf{W}^{-1}\\tilde{\\mathbf{y}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">b</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.404em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.054em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.3029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6813em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.3634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>关键在于权重矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{W}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 取什么。取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{W} = \\mathbf{I}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 得到的是<strong>OLS 调和</strong>，它对所有层级的偏离一视同仁；取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{W}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 为基预测误差的协方差对角阵（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">diag</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">W</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{W} = \\operatorname{diag}(\\mathbf{W}_1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">diag</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.016em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>）得到 <strong>WLS</strong>；取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{W}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 为完整的误差协方差矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">W</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{W}_h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8361em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.016em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（含跨序列的误差相关）得到的就是 <strong>MinT</strong>。当噪声很大、协方差难以稳定估计时，还有收缩版本 <strong>MinT(Sample)</strong> 与 <strong>MinT(Shrink)</strong>，后者用 Ledoit-Wolf 式收缩把协方差向对角阵收缩（Ledoit、Wolf，<em>Journal of Multivariate Analysis</em>，2004，88(2):365-411，<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/s0047-259x(03)00096-4\">https://doi.org/10.1016/s0047-259x(03)00096-4</a> ），在实践中通常是稳健的首选。</p>\n<p>三种朴素策略都可以在 MinT 框架下被重新解释：自上而下等价于对叶子层的基预测取某种特殊权重，自下而上等价于把权重放到叶子层。MinT 的价值在于<strong>让权重由数据决定，而不是由人的判断决定</strong>，且能同时利用「跨序列的误差相关」这一被三种策略完全忽略的信息。</p>\n<p>调和带来的收益有多大？Hyndman 与 Athanasopoulos 的 <em>Forecasting: Principles and Practice</em>（第 3 版，OTexts，第 11 章「Forecasting hierarchical and grouped time series」专论调和，<a href=\"https://otexts.com/fpp3/\">https://otexts.com/fpp3/</a> ）与多篇实证研究给出的量级是：在层级结构中，调和通常能把基础预测的准确度提升若干个百分点，且提升在<strong>上层</strong>特别明显——这正是因为上层原本被叶子噪声污染。注意调和不改变「这条序列能不能预测」，它只是把已有的信息分配得更合理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"调和在工程中的实现要点\">调和在工程中的实现要点</h2><p>把调和落地时有五个工程细节决定成败。</p>\n<p><strong>第一，矩阵不能显式构造</strong>。一个十万 SKU、四个国家的结构，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{S}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^5 \\times 10^5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 量级，显式求逆不可能。实现上要利用结构：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{S}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 的稀疏聚合性质让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">W</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\mathbf{S}^{\\top}\\mathbf{W}^{-1}\\mathbf{S})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 可以用逐层累加的方式构造，实际运算量是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>深度</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\cdot \\text{深度})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">深度</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 而不是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。或者更简单：逐层做局部调和（每对父子单独调和），在树结构上这个近似与全局解的差距通常很小。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，协方差要滚动估计并收缩</strong>。MinT 的权重来自历史上基预测的误差。工程上取最近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 期的滚动误差窗口，用滑动窗口估计协方差并施加收缩，同时处理「序列太短无法估计」的情况——退化为按层级的方差对角阵，再退化为单位阵。</p>\n<p><strong>第三，分位数也要调和</strong>。如果只调和点预测，分位数预测会立即破坏一致性（各层的 95% 分位数加起来不等于上层的 95% 分位数）。正确做法是在分位数空间中做调和（对每个分位点分别解一次），或者用 copula 方法重建联合分布（概率型调和的系统性讨论见 Panagiotelis、Gamakumara、Athanasopoulos、Hyndman，<em>European Journal of Operational Research</em>，2023，306(2):693-706，<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ejor.2022.07.040\">https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ejor.2022.07.040</a> ）。前者实现简单、可接受；后者更精确但成本高。这一点与第三章第一节的安全库存直接相关——如果上下层分位数不一致，采购会按某层下单而财务按另一层预算。</p>\n<p><strong>第四，调和要在预测的消费端可见</strong>。业务看到的不应只是调和后的数字，还应能看到「调和前 vs 调和后」的差异。差异大的单元往往意味着该单元的历史误差与其他层显著不同，这本身是很有价值的诊断信息。</p>\n<p><strong>第五，口径一致性优先于调和算法</strong>。很多所谓的「层级对不上」根本不是预测问题，而是口径问题：某一层统计的是出库量、另一层统计的是签收量；某一层含退货、另一层不含；某一层按本币、另一层按美元且用了不同汇率。调和不能（也不该）修复口径错误，它只会把一个错误的数字一致化。所以实施调和之前，先做一次口径审计。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐做法</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>叶子噪声大，顶层稳定</td>\n<td>MinT，权重偏向顶层</td>\n<td>用误差大小自动决定话语权</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新市场叶子很少</td>\n<td>逐层局部调和</td>\n<td>协方差无法稳定估计，全局解不可靠</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要概率一致性</td>\n<td>分位数空间调和或 copula</td>\n<td>只调点值会让区间上下打架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>层级深但业务只关心两个层级</td>\n<td>只对该两层建 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{S}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">S</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>避免为无用层级付出成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>历史短、序列少</td>\n<td>OLS 调和或自下而上</td>\n<td>协方差估计不可靠时，简单策略更稳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存在口径不一致</td>\n<td>先修口径，再谈调和</td>\n<td>调和不能修复错误的口径</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"与多市场业务的三处接口\">与多市场业务的三处接口</h2><p>调和的输出会直接影响后面三章的输入，有三处接口值得点明。</p>\n<p><strong>接口一是安全库存的分位数</strong>（见 <a href=\"../uncertainty/confidence-interval-stock\">预测区间与安全库存联动</a>）。如果采购在「国家 × SKU」层下单，但它读到的分位数是未调和版本，那么各国家的安全库存之和会不等于区域级安全库存。这种不一致在季度预算时会暴露成「总部的库存目标与各国的采购计划对不上」。解决方式是在下单所用层级上取调和后的分位数。</p>\n<p><strong>接口二是跨市场迁移的先验</strong>（见 <a href=\"cross-market-transfer\">跨市场迁移（成熟市场帮新兴）</a>）。迁移得到的是新兴市场的先验预测，它与成熟市场的预测必须在同一层级体系中融合。此时调和的作用不只是让数字一致，还包括把「成熟市场的误差结构」传播给新兴市场作为不确定性的先验——这需要协方差而不是仅点值。</p>\n<p><strong>接口三是本地日历导致的层级不同步</strong>（见 <a href=\"local-festival-calendar\">本地节日/事件日历特征</a>）。不同国家的节假日不同，所以「周」这个时间层级在各国的语义并不相同（宗教国家的周起始日、斋月的作息变化）。做时间维调和时不要跨市场套用同一套时间桶，否则会把节假日的形状抹平。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>层级调和的本质是把父子约束写成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{y} = \\mathbf{S}\\mathbf{b}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Sb</span></span></span></span></span>，并在满足它的前提下最小化与基预测的加权偏离。</li>\n<li>自下而上、自上而下、中间层三种朴素策略各自在叶子噪声、份额稳定性、层级选择上失效，且都忽略跨序列误差相关。</li>\n<li>MinT 用误差协方差矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{W}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 统一三种策略，取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{W}=\\mathbf{I}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 是 OLS、取对角阵是 WLS、取完整协方差是 MinT；实践中收缩版本最稳健。</li>\n<li>调和的收益在上层最明显，因为它原本被叶子噪声污染。</li>\n<li>工程实现要利用树的稀疏结构避免显式矩阵求逆，协方差要滚动估计并收缩，协方差无法估计时退化到简单策略。</li>\n<li>分位数也必须调和，否则上下层的置信区间会互相打架，直接影响安全库存与预算对账。</li>\n<li>口径不一致不是调和能解决的问题；实施调和前必须先做一次口径审计。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分市场预测与层级汇总调和","id":"分市场预测与层级汇总调和"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：层级一致性与聚合矩阵","id":"核心概念-层级一致性与聚合矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"层级结构的定义与四个维度","id":"层级结构的定义与四个维度"},{"level":2,"text":"三种朴素策略及其失效场景","id":"三种朴素策略及其失效场景"},{"level":2,"text":"MinT：用误差协方差统一三种策略","id":"mint-用误差协方差统一三种策略"},{"level":2,"text":"调和在工程中的实现要点","id":"调和在工程中的实现要点"},{"level":2,"text":"与多市场业务的三处接口","id":"与多市场业务的三处接口"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"长尾与新品冷启动预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/demand-forecast-replenishment/forecast-methods/longtail-new-product"},"next":{"title":"跨市场迁移（成熟市场帮新兴）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/demand-forecast-replenishment/multi-market-forecast/cross-market-transfer"}}